[I] IMS Data service daemon for QMI/QRTR mobile modems

[T] 81voltd implements the IMS Data service on the QMI/QRTR protocol, handling
[T] requests from the modem firmware to start and stop VoLTE/IMS data
[T] connections through the ModemManager D-Bus API, as used on postmarketOS
[T] mobile devices.

[U] https://gitlab.postmarketos.org/modem/81voltd

